10 different conditions for class "1" (Yes - client has high credit scoring):  
- Debt <= 1000  
- Overdue days = 0  
- Initial limit >= 5000  
- INCOME >= 3000  
- Credit history rating is in [A1, A2, A3, B1, B2, B3]  
- PDN < 0.1  
- EDU is in [University, College]  
